   the FCL (see LICENSE.md).

2. A file that carries an upstream notice together with the line "Modified by
   Alokin LLC" is an upstream PySpur file that Alokin LLC changed. The
   upstream code in it remains under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
   LICENSE-APACHE). Alokin LLC's modifications are licensed under the FCL (see
   LICENSE.md).

3. A file without a header is upstream PySpur code that Alokin LLC has not
